WEBVTT

00:00:29.525 --> 00:00:31.235
And just post on Twitter.

00:00:33.071 --> 00:00:34.238
That's what I did,

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:36.866
because it allowed me
to find people all over the world

00:00:36.908 --> 00:00:38.534
willing to help me figure it out.

00:00:39.077 --> 00:00:41.871
My new internet friends and I
started a group chat,

00:00:41.913 --> 00:00:43.498
pooled cryptocurrency,

00:00:43.498 --> 00:00:45.124
researched locations,

00:00:45.166 --> 00:00:46.751
and three months later,

00:00:46.793 --> 00:00:49.170
we bought 40 acres of land

00:00:49.212 --> 00:00:52.006
near Yellowstone National Park in Wyoming.

00:00:53.591 --> 00:00:57.929
Now we had a piece of land,
a pool of money,

00:00:57.970 --> 00:01:00.807
and a lot of decisions
to make collectively.